sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant M as main.cpp wWinMain
    participant C as common (RelaunchAsAdmin)
    participant W as AppWindow
    participant MOD as IModule
    participant ENG as CleanerEngine
    participant PR as ProcessRunner
    participant OS as OS/SCM/Scheduler

    rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
    Note over U,OS: Flow 1: R1 auto-elevation launch (loop-proof)
    U->>M: double-click launch (standard user)
    M->>M: parse argv, strip --elev-attempted if present
    alt already elevated or already attempted (MZ_ELEV_ATTEMPTED)
        M->>W: RunAppWindow (normal start)
    else not elevated and never attempted
        M->>C: SetEnvironmentVariable(MZ_ELEV_ATTEMPTED=1)
        M->>C: RelaunchAsAdmin(params, cwd)
        C->>OS: ShellExecuteExW(verb=runas)
        alt UAC approved
            OS-->>M: new instance (inherits env var, attempted=1)
            M-->>U: current instance exits; new instance enters GUI
        else UAC cancelled (ERROR_CANCELLED)
            C-->>M: ElevateResult::Cancelled
            M->>W: continue as standard user + log note
        end
    end
    Note over U,OS: CLI branch (main.cpp:15-36) never enters elevation logic
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
    Note over U,OS: Flow 2: R5 cleaning (deletion matrix + per-file reporting)
    U->>W: clean.system → start scan
    W->>MOD: StartWork(apply=false) → Run(ctx,out)
    MOD->>ENG: RunScan(SystemClean)
    ENG->>ENG: fast scan (parent/child dedup pruning)
    ENG-->>W: ScanOutcome（FileRepository etc. flagged reportOnly）
    U->>W: select rows → clean → ConfirmDialog(danger)
    W->>MOD: StartWork(apply=true) → Apply(ctx,out)(worker thread)
    loop each non-reportOnly item
        MOD->>ENG: CleanDirectoryContentsEx(dir, cancel, report)
        loop each file (deep mode)
            ENG->>OS: L1 DeleteFileW
            alt fails (5)
                ENG->>OS: L2 clear file+parent attrs, retry
            else fails (32/33)
                ENG->>OS: L3 backoff retry x3 (cancellable)
            else still fails (system in use)
                ENG->>OS: L4 MoveFileEx(DELAY_UNTIL_REBOOT)
            else Download folder
                ENG->>OS: L5 stop wuauserv/cryptsvc → delete → restore services
            end
            ENG-->>MOD: CleanFileResult{path, code}
        end
    end
    MOD-->>W: kMsgDone: freed bytes + failure breakdown (localized causes)
    W-->>U: summary + per-item log + failure list
    end

    rect rgb(255, 246, 235)
    Note over U,OS: Flow 3: R3/R4 extended actions (services / scheduled tasks)
    U->>W: sys.services → scan (tag = service-name index)
    W->>MOD: Run(ctx,out) enumerate SCM
    U->>W: select services → Stop selected or overflow-menu action
    W->>W: ConfirmDialog（ModuleAction.warning）
    W->>MOD: StartWork(actionIndex=N) → RunAction(ctx,N)(worker thread)
    MOD->>OS: OpenService(SC_MANAGER_CONNECT+required rights)
    MOD->>OS: ControlService(STOP) / StartServiceW / ChangeServiceConfigW
    OS-->>MOD: success / error code (Win32Err localized map)
    MOD-->>W: kMsgDone
    W->>MOD: RefreshAfterAction()==true → auto rescan
    W-->>U: state column updated + failure reason (e.g. protected service)
    end

    rect rgb(250, 240, 255)
    Note over U,OS: Flow 4: R6 security repair long task
    U->>W: sec.repair → DISM RestoreHealth
    W->>MOD: RunAction(worker thread)
    MOD->>PR: RunProcess(dism..., timeout=30min, cancel)
    loop line by line
        PR-->>MOD: onLine(line)
        MOD-->>W: ctx.Log → LogView live scroll
    end
    alt user presses Esc
        U->>W: cancel
        W->>PR: cancel() → TerminateProcess
    end
    PR-->>MOD: exit code + full output
    MOD-->>W: parse verdict (fixed / not found / unrepairable)
    end
